<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 20.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 20.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, March 20 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    20.03.97     19.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.3716	 6.3556</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3790	 2.3648</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6046	 4.5808</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2486	 3.2481</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5202	 0.5170</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7908	 0.7860</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2973	 0.2957</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8853	 6.8794</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6997	 0.7010</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3029	 1.2979</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas,  Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
